	(text "100n at every VCCIO/VCORE/VREGIN/VPHY/VPLL pin.\nC19: effective capacitance >=3.3uF at 1.8 V.\nAll 4u7 ceramics: 50 V X7R, 1206; verify DC-bias curves.\nDo not connect USB VBUS to board VCC or VDD."
